! Live equivocation ~ owed to later spirits (the research queue)

The exposure, its blind spot and the field's answers read at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/live-equivocation`>>. This record carries the queue the federated-mesh collision (2026-09-09) opened on it; the queue serves the work and leaves for the realm workbench when that home stands.

# ''Outside negentropy'' — collide the live-equivocation case against the field: KERI/vLEI live-key recovery ceremonies, threshold re-keying (FROST resharing), social-recovery wallets (Argent, safe-guardians), duress/coercion-resistant schemes (deniable keys, canaries), MPC custody rotation. What does anyone deployed do when a key gets stolen WHILE ALIVE?
# ''Fiction user stories'' — mine the Elyncia canon for concrete hijack/inheritance/dormancy scenarios and render each as a QA vector against the mechanics.
# ''The ruling'' — the operator leaned PULL RECOVERY-QUORUM FORWARD beside the sensorium (co-design detection + recovery), and set that lean aside on 2026-09-13 until measured detection latency can decide it (api/pono/live-equivocation#/what-decides-it). A later pass confirms the sequence and the recovery-rotation ⊥ equivocation-fork distinction a watcher must draw. See the code seam `packages/lararium-mesh/src/recovery-registration.ts` and <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road#/after-the-seat`>> (`W30`).

